2
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,500
惰慢姫
[Lazy Princess]

3
00:02:57,300 --> 00:03:00,600
バズスリップ 好きなステップで踊り出すビート
Buzz slip, dancing to the beat with my favorite steps

4
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:04,100
宵に輝くネオンの下で光る
Shining under the neon lights that glow in the evening

5
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:08,700
私 可愛い可愛い召使い達 あの子はどこに？
My cute, cute servants, where is that child?

6
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:12,700
うだうだ ゴロゴロ ガラガラ にゃんにゃん 何もし損ねた
Idling, rolling around, clattering, meowing, I failed to do anything

7
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:14,900
甘い甘い チョコが食べたい
I want to eat sweet, sweet chocolate

8
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:17,000
熱い熱い ラテが飲みたい
I want to drink hot, hot latte

9
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,300
サクサクのパン 食べたいの
I want to eat crispy bread...

10
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:20,400
ダメ？
Is that a no?

11
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,500
とろとろのチーズ 食べたい
I want to eat melty cheese

12
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:24,600
ふかふかのベッドで寝たい
I want to sleep in a fluffy bed

13
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,700
うとうと おやすみなさい
Dozing off... Good night

14
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:28,100
すぴー
Snooze...

15
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:30,300
わがままらんらんらん
Selfish, ran-ran-ran

16
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:34,500
怒らないで 私可愛いそうでしょ
Don't be mad, I look so cute, right?

17
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:38,700
お願いギブギブミー 尽くして愛届けて
Please, give, give to me, serve me and send me love

18
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:41,800
何事も許される
Anything and everything is forgiven

19
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:46,000
だって私が一番可愛いんだから
Because I'm the absolute cutest, after all

20
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:03,700
スリッツ 香ばしい匂いで騒ぎ出すビート
Sweets, the beat goes wild with a sweet scent

21
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:07,400
宵月明かりの下で
Under the evening moonlight

22
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:11,800
誰をやーる？ ギロチン 銃殺 火あぶり 切腹 お好きなオプションで
Who should I do in? Guillotine, firing squad, burning at the stake, seppuku, choose your favorite option

23
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:15,800
誰も私には勝てない 偽りはいらない
No one can defeat me, I don't need falseness

24
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:18,000
苦い苦い キモが食べたい
I want to eat bitter, bitter liver

25
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,100
赤い赤い スープ飲みたい
I want to drink red, red soup

26
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,300
コクコク お肉食べたいの
I want to eat rich, flavorful meat

27
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:23,300
甘ーい！
So sweet!

28
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:25,500
甘い甘い それじゃ足りない
Sweet, sweet, that's still not enough

29
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,700
油断の隙 また見せて
Show me a slip in your guard again

30
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:30,000
ラランラランラランララン
La-ran, la-ran, la-ran, la-ran

31
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,000
ほら まだまだ足りないわ
Look, it's still not enough

32
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:56,500
わがままな私のこと愛してくれる誰かを待っているの
I'm waiting for someone who will love me for being so selfish

33
00:04:56,500 --> 00:05:00,000
孤独じゃないって言いにひとり目を覚まして
Waking up alone just to say I'm not lonely

34
00:05:00,148 --> 00:05:03,548
洋服もまだ迷ってる
I'm still undecided on what to wear...

35
00:05:03,848 --> 00:05:05,548
だって私が
Because I'm...

36
00:05:05,948 --> 00:05:09,248
ね？ わがままなランタン
Right? A selfish lantern.

37
00:05:09,248 --> 00:05:12,548
誰も怖がらないって
They say no one is afraid of me...

38
00:05:12,548 --> 00:05:15,948
私可愛いでしょう？
Aren't I cute?

39
00:05:16,048 --> 00:05:19,448
お願い ギブギブミー 全て与え続けて
Please, give, give me, keep giving me everything...

40
00:05:19,448 --> 00:05:22,848
何もかも許される
Everything is forgiven...

41
00:05:23,048 --> 00:05:26,548
やっぱ私が一番可愛いんだから
After all, I'm the cutest of all.

42
00:06:03,348 --> 00:06:05,548
Myth or treat

43
00:06:10,048 --> 00:06:11,248
Trick or treat

44
00:06:11,248 --> 00:06:17,548
キミの推しはクローゼットの中でドッキリを仕掛けた
Your fave set up a prank inside the closet

45
00:06:17,548 --> 00:06:20,548
TRICK OR TREAT ほら もうキャンディーはない
TRICK OR TREAT, look, there's no more candy

46
00:06:20,548 --> 00:06:24,048
お腹がいっぱい？ じゃあ、チェーンソーの出番かな？
Full already? Then is it time for the chainsaw?

47
00:06:24,048 --> 00:06:29,948
みんなが取り憑かれた その仮説を確かめよう 解剖しよう
Everyone's possessed—let me test that hypothesis and dissect it

48
00:06:29,948 --> 00:06:33,248
踊れ 隠れないで 泣き虫
Dance, don't hide, crybaby

49
00:06:33,248 --> 00:06:37,048
幻獣のない HALLOWEEN は面白くない Haha
Halloween without mythical beasts is no fun, haha

50
00:06:37,548 --> 00:06:45,548
みんなが照れている
Everyone is glowing

51
00:06:46,048 --> 00:06:48,048
かわいい
How cute

52
00:06:48,048 --> 00:06:59,848
熱くなった血をくれるでしょう？
You'll give us your heated blood, right?

53
00:07:01,048 --> 00:07:02,848
Myth or treat

54
00:07:02,848 --> 00:07:06,048
あぁ、呪いの配信
Ah, a cursed stream

55
00:07:06,048 --> 00:07:09,048
びびって叫んじゃえ！
Get scared and scream!

56
00:07:09,048 --> 00:07:15,848
見せるよ今夜だけ まだ見ぬ恐ろしい顔を
Only tonight, we'll show you an unseen, terrifying face

57
00:07:15,848 --> 00:07:19,248
なんてガチ恋 NIGHT
What a true-love NIGHT

58
00:07:19,248 --> 00:07:22,048
魔女たちの出番だ
It's time for the witches to take the stage

59
00:07:22,048 --> 00:07:28,548
もう逃げられないよ 捧げて君の魂を
You can't run away anymore, surrender your soul

60
00:07:29,048 --> 00:07:30,548
踊りだせ TONIGHT
Start dancing TONIGHT

61
00:07:30,548 --> 00:07:32,048
見て恐ろしい SIGHT
Look at this terrifying SIGHT

62
00:07:32,048 --> 00:07:35,348
腹ペコだ、食べたいねぇ、ちょうだい？
Starving, want to eat, won't you give it to me?

63
00:07:35,348 --> 00:07:38,848
恐怖でびびらせ 一緒に歌おう
Scared out of your wits, let me hear you sing along

64
00:07:38,848 --> 00:07:41,548
「嫁」じゃなくて かぼちゃよ DING-DONG？
Not a "wife", it's a pumpkin, DING-DONG?

65
00:07:41,548 --> 00:07:44,848
墓場で待ってる 覚悟できてる？
Waiting in the graveyard, are you prepared?

66
00:07:44,848 --> 00:07:47,548
我らの歌で盛り上がるがいい！
Get hyped up with our song!

67
00:07:47,548 --> 00:07:48,548
べー！ふふっ
Bleah! Hehe

68
00:07:48,548 --> 00:07:50,048
おびえて叫べ！
Cower and scream!

69
00:07:50,048 --> 00:07:54,848
MYTHが暴れる これぞ我らのスタイル
MYTH goes wild, this is our style

70
00:08:04,548 --> 00:08:08,248
イエーイ！
Yay!

71
00:08:08,548 --> 00:08:11,848
やったー！ 楽しかったー！
Yay! That was so much fun!

72
00:08:12,048 --> 00:08:15,848
いやー、すごかった！ いい曲だったね！
Wow, that was amazing! What a great song!

73
00:08:15,848 --> 00:08:20,548
ねー！ ほんとに！ 歌えてめっちゃ嬉しい！
Right?! Seriously! I'm so happy we got to sing it!

74
00:08:20,848 --> 00:08:24,548
あー、早く私も3Dで踊りたいよー！
Ah, I want to dance in 3D soon too!

75
00:08:24,548 --> 00:08:29,848
見たい！ オリジナルの3D早く見たい！
I want to see it! I want to see your 3D model soon!

76
00:08:29,848 --> 00:08:31,548
いつになれるのー？
When will that be?

77
00:08:31,548 --> 00:08:33,848
分かんなーい！
I don't know!

78
00:08:34,548 --> 00:08:39,848
分かんないけど、楽しみにしててねー！
I don't know, but please look forward to it!

79
00:08:39,848 --> 00:08:44,248
でもなんか、今日2Dだけど、そう、いい感じに後ろにさ！
But even though you're in 2D today, you're set up so nicely in the background!

80
00:08:44,248 --> 00:08:47,048
ね！ 確かに！ 画面がすごい！
Right! Definitely! The screen looks amazing!

81
00:08:47,048 --> 00:08:51,548
でかい！ でかいね！
It's huge! Huge!

82
00:08:51,548 --> 00:08:56,548
そうだね！ すごい！
That's right! Amazing!

83
00:08:56,548 --> 00:09:03,048
このMyth or Treatは元々ENのみんなで英語で歌った曲だったんだけど
Myth or Treat was originally sung in English by all of EN,

84
00:09:03,048 --> 00:09:08,548
日本語でまさか歌えるなんて思ってなかったです！ 嬉しい！
but I never thought we'd get to sing it in Japanese! I'm so happy!

85
00:09:09,048 --> 00:09:15,548
うん！ でもこの曲さ、聴いたときからめっちゃ大好きな曲だったから、嬉しいよー！
Yeah! I've loved this song ever since I first heard it, so I'm so glad!

86
00:09:15,548 --> 00:09:21,048
日本語版すごい自然に聞こえて、すごく歌いやすくてすごかった！
The Japanese version sounded so natural and was so easy to sing! It was awesome!

87
00:09:21,048 --> 00:09:27,248
ほんと？ 結構自分でね、「これやったら可愛いかな？」っていう風にちょっと直してみた！
Really? I actually adjusted the lyrics a bit myself, thinking "would this be cuter?"

88
00:09:27,248 --> 00:09:30,548
おー！ すごい！ 自分で？
Oh! Wow! Yourself?

89
00:09:30,548 --> 00:09:35,848
メル様のこの誕生日に歌うっていうのもね、なかなかじゃないですか！
And singing it on Mel-sama's birthday like this is pretty special, isn't it!

90
00:09:35,848 --> 00:09:40,848
おー、嬉しい！ やっぱハロウィンだからさ、ぴったりだよね、この曲ね！
Oh, I'm so happy! Since it's Halloween, this song is perfect!

91
00:09:40,848 --> 00:09:43,848
ね！ ハロウィン！
Right! Halloween!

92
00:09:43,848 --> 00:09:48,548
いやもうメル様お誕生日おめでとう！
Happy Birthday, Mel-sama!

93
00:09:48,548 --> 00:09:54,548
この後もいろいろあるんじゃないですか？
Don't you have a lot more planned after this?

94
00:09:54,548 --> 00:10:00,048
あ、そうなんだよ！ まだ2曲目だからさ、まだまだ歌うんだけど...
Ah, that's right! This is only the second song, so I still have plenty left to sing...

95
00:10:00,063 --> 00:10:01,863
え、なんか帰る感じ？
Huh? Are you guys leaving already?

96
00:10:01,863 --> 00:10:08,563
いやー、今日はね、ハロウィンだから、また他のお友達にお菓子いっぱいもらいに行かないといけないんです〜
Well, today is Halloween, so we have to go get lots of candy from our other friends~

97
00:10:08,863 --> 00:10:10,263
え？ちょっと待って！
Wait, hold on!

98
00:10:10,263 --> 00:10:13,863
だってさ、魔界のチョコがさ、めちゃめちゃ言ってた、チョコお腹すいた〜
Because Choco from the Demon Realm was constantly complaining, "Choco is so hungry~"

99
00:10:13,863 --> 00:10:15,563
あ〜分かる！お腹すいた〜！
Ah, I get it! I'm so hungry!

100
00:10:15,563 --> 00:10:18,063
食べに行っちゃう？食べに行っちゃう？
Should we go eat? Should we go eat?

101
00:10:18,063 --> 00:10:19,863
ちょっと待って！メルも行きたい！
Wait a second! Mel wants to go too!

102
00:10:19,863 --> 00:10:22,563
ダメダメダメ！いっぱいあるー！
No, no, no! There's plenty to get!

103
00:10:22,563 --> 00:10:24,263
待ってよー！
Wait up!

104
00:10:24,263 --> 00:10:26,563
ねぇ、ズルい！ズルい！置いていかないで！待って！
Hey, that's not fair! Don't leave me behind! Wait!

105
00:10:26,563 --> 00:10:30,063
あー！待ってよー！待ってー！
Ahhh! Wait for me! Wait!

106
00:10:30,563 --> 00:10:32,263
頑張ってね〜！
Good luck out there~!

107
00:10:34,063 --> 00:10:37,063
おい、ちょっとよ…「頑張ってね」って…
Hey, wait a minute... What do you mean, "Good luck"?

108
00:10:37,063 --> 00:10:41,263
えー？本当に…もう寂しいじゃん！
Huh? Seriously... Now I'm all lonely!

109
00:10:42,563 --> 00:10:46,063
あ、でも今日はね、かぷみんのみんながいるよね！
Ah, but today, all of you Kapumin are here with me, right?

110
00:10:46,263 --> 00:10:47,863
よし！
Alright!

111
00:10:47,863 --> 00:10:49,863
改めてみんな、こんかぷー！
Once again, Konkapu, everyone!

112
00:10:49,863 --> 00:10:53,863
魔界の天才ヴァンパイア、夜空メルでーす！
I'm the genius vampire of the Demon Realm, Yozora Mel!

113
00:10:53,863 --> 00:10:57,063
今日は最後まで楽しんでいってください！
Please enjoy yourselves until the very end today!

114
00:10:57,063 --> 00:11:03,063
そしてそして、#夜空メル生誕2022 でいっぱいツイートしてね！
And also, please tweet a lot with #夜空メル生誕2022!

115
00:11:03,263 --> 00:11:06,063
写真もバシャバシャ撮ってください！
Take tons of screenshots too!

116
00:11:06,063 --> 00:11:08,563
後でメル、見に行くからな！
Mel will go check them out later!

117
00:11:08,563 --> 00:11:11,063
約束だよ！
That's a promise!

118
00:11:11,563 --> 00:11:15,563
この後もまだまだコラボとか、ソロ曲とか、たくさん続くので、
There are still plenty of collabs and solo songs coming up after this,

119
00:11:15,563 --> 00:11:18,863
ぜひぜひ最後まで楽しんでいってください！
so please be sure to enjoy until the very end!

120
00:11:19,563 --> 00:11:21,063
よーし、それじゃあ！
Alright then!

121
00:11:21,063 --> 00:11:25,563
この後も、一緒に楽しんでいくぞー！
Let's keep having fun for the rest of the show!

122
00:11:40,063 --> 00:11:42,063
Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!

123
00:11:42,063 --> 00:11:44,063
Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!

124
00:11:44,063 --> 00:11:46,063
Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!

125
00:11:46,063 --> 00:11:48,063
Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!

126
00:11:48,063 --> 00:11:51,063
戦場へ! 前線へ! そして死の淵まで!
To the battlefield! To the front lines! And to the brink of death!

127
00:11:51,063 --> 00:11:56,063
命捨てたその覚悟を示せ!
Show the resolve of having cast your life away!

128
00:12:00,063 --> 00:12:03,563
聴こえるだろう あの砲声が
You can hear it, can't you? That roar of artillery...

129
00:12:03,563 --> 00:12:07,563
抵抗する蠢の音だ
It's the sound of squirming resistance!

130
00:12:07,563 --> 00:12:11,863
踏み潰せ! 踏み潰せ!
Crush them underfoot! Trample them down!

131
00:12:11,863 --> 00:12:14,263
諸君、我々の任務は何だ？
Gentlemen, what is our mission?

132
00:12:14,263 --> 00:12:15,563
殲滅だ！
Annihilation!

133
00:12:15,563 --> 00:12:17,063
一機残らずの殲滅だ！
Complete annihilation, down to the last unit!

134
00:12:17,063 --> 00:12:18,563
為すべきことは唯一つ
There is only one thing left to do...

135
00:12:18,563 --> 00:12:20,063
地獄を創れ！
Create a hell!

136
00:12:20,063 --> 00:12:22,063
何故炎の中進んで行くのか
Why do we march into the flames?

137
00:12:22,063 --> 00:12:24,063
弾丸の雨に打たれに行くのか
Why do we march into a hail of bullets?

138
00:12:24,063 --> 00:12:28,563
笑止千万! 帝国の為だ!
Laughable! It is for the Empire!

139
00:12:30,063 --> 00:12:33,063
戦場へ! 前線へ! そして死の淵まで!
To the battlefield! To the front lines! And to the brink of death!

140
00:12:33,063 --> 00:12:37,063
命捨てた覚悟を示せよ!
Show the resolve of having cast your life away!

141
00:12:37,063 --> 00:12:42,063
忠誠を! 従順を! そして其の魂を
Offer up your loyalty! Your obedience! And all your soul!

142
00:12:42,063 --> 00:12:45,563
全て捧げ勝鬨を上げよ!
Sacrifice everything and raise a cry of victory!

143
00:12:45,563 --> 00:12:49,563
さあ此処に築いてみせろ!
Now, build it here before us!

144
00:12:49,563 --> 00:12:55,563
天に届く死体の山を!
A mountain of corpses reaching up to the heavens!

145
00:12:55,563 --> 00:12:57,563
Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!

146
00:12:57,563 --> 00:12:59,563
Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!

147
00:12:59,563 --> 00:13:01,563
Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!

148
00:13:01,563 --> 00:13:04,063
Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!

149
00:13:04,563 --> 00:13:08,563
どこに恐怖があると言うんだ
Where is this fear you speak of?

